Package: processLM
Title: Process lm Objects
Version: 0.0.10
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Ivan Jacob Agaloos",
           family = "Pesigan",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "r.jeksterslab@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4818-8420"))
Description: Preprocessing helper functions for the 'lm' object:
    sample moments, standardized and selectively standardized partial
    regression slopes, R-squared and adjusted R-squared, semipartial
    and partial correlations, Cohen's f-squared, differences of slopes,
    and Monte Carlo draws of the model-implied covariance matrices.
    The internal functions have no input checks and are copied by other
    projects.
URL: https://github.com/ijapesigan/processLM,
        https://ijapesigan.github.io/processLM/
